# Static files served from the root: /robots.txt is generated by robots.ts and
# /sitemap.xml by sitemap.ts, so this is for anything that has to be a file —
# a favicon, an og:image, a verification token a search engine asks for.
#
# Kept even while empty because apps/storefront/Dockerfile copies it, and a
# missing directory fails the image build rather than being skipped.
